-- title:
--   Projection formula for evaluation of functions at divisors
-- statement:
--   Let $K \subseteq F \subseteq F'$ be fields, with $F'$ an $F$-algebra that is integral over $F$ and compatible with the $K$-algebra structures. Here a place of $F$ over $K$ is a valuation subring of $F$ containing the image of $K$, different from $F$ itself and a principal ideal ring, and a divisor is a finitely supported function from the places of $F'$ over $K$ to $\mathbb{Z}$. Let $g \in F$ be nonzero and let $D$ be such a divisor of $F'$, subject to three conditions on every place $w$ in the support of $D$: the residue field of $w$ is generated by the image of $K$ (i.e. the structure map from $K$ to the residue field is surjective), the same holds for the restricted place $w|_F$, obtained by pulling back the valuation subring of $w$ along $F \to F'$, and $\mathrm{ord}_{w|_F}(g) = 0$, where $\mathrm{ord}$ is minus the logarithm of the associated $\mathbb{Z}^{m0}$-valued adic valuation. The conclusion is $$\prod_{w} \big(\mathrm{ev}_w(g_{F'})\big)^{D(w)} = \prod_{v} \big(\mathrm{ev}_v(g)\big)^{(\pi_* D)(v)},$$ where $g_{F'}$ is the image of $g$ in $F'$, $\mathrm{ev}_v(f) \in K$ is the element of $K$ whose image in the residue field of $v$ is the residue of $f$ when $f$ lies in the valuation subring of $v$ and is $0$ otherwise, and $\pi_* D = \sum_w [\kappa(w):\kappa(w|_F)]\, D(w)\,\delta_{w|_F}$ is the push-forward divisor weighted by the inertia degrees $\mathrm{finrank}_{\kappa(w|_F)} \kappa(w)$.
--
--   This is one half of the projection formula for the evaluation pairing between functions and divisors: pulling a function back along $F \hookrightarrow F'$ and evaluating at $D$ agrees with evaluating the function itself at the push-forward of $D$. It is used in the construction and comparison of the divisorial Weil pairing, in particular in the correspondence-compatibility and injectivity statements for the induced homomorphism.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_AlgebraicCurve_Divisor_evalFun_algebraMap_pushforward.lean

